    "CoiStatement": "The individual declaration of conflicts of interest is available on demand at the EULAR secretariat and is summarised below: CID has received honoraria from BMS, MSD, Pfizer, Roche-Chugai and UCB, and research grants from MSD, Pfizer, Roche-Chugai and UCB. BC has received honoraria from BMS, Janssen, Lilly, MSD, Novartis, Pfizer, Roche-Chugai and UCB, and research grants from Pfizer, Roche-Chugai and UCB. RL has received honoraria and/or research grants from AbbVie, Ablynx, Amgen, Astra-Zeneca, Bristol Myers Squibb, Celgene, Janssen, Galapagos, Glaxo-Smith-Kline, Novartis, Novo-Nordisk, Merck, Pfizer, Roche, TiGenix and UCB. RL is director of Rheumatology Consultancy BV.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "e000404"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
